{
  "name": "每日竞品 Google 广告上线 Slack 预警",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 每日竞品 Google 广告 Slack 监控预警\n\n以定时任务形式在 `monitor` 监控模式下每日运行。检测 Google 广告透明度中心中的竞品域名，一旦上线新广告即时向 Slack 推送预警。\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 为什么监控模式不会消息泛滥\nGoogle 默认按最后展示时间排序，旧广告经常因偶发曝光重新浮至首页。本 Actor 锚定 `firstShown` 首次展示时间，仅上报真正的新广告（平均每域名每天约 0.4 条）。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：每返回 1,000 条广告从 $0.70 起（Free 阶梯 $0.0012，Gold 阶梯低至 $0.0007），监控模式每次竞品检测 $0.01。仅返回 Google 官方 firstShown 时间确属新上线的广告。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/google-ads-monitor-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t1-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-schedule",
      "name": "每日定时触发器",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~google-ads-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"targets\": [\"hubspot.com\", \"zoom.us\"],\n  \"mode\": \"monitor\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "t1-check",
      "name": "检测竞品广告 (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "bc19dbf6-068e-4ef9-b4b9-5a17391518bc",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.creativeId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t1-filter",
      "name": "过滤新增广告",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#competitor-ads",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=🚨 *New Google Ad Detected for {{ $json.target }}*\n*Advertiser:* {{ $json.advertiserName }}\n*Format:* {{ $json.format }}\n*Headline:* {{ $json.headline || 'N/A' }}\n*Description:* {{ $json.description || 'N/A' }}\n*Link:* {{ $json.adUrl }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "t1-slack",
      "name": "发送 Slack 预警通知",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "id": "slack-bot",
          "name": "Slack Bot"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "每日定时触发器": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "检测竞品广告 (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "检测竞品广告 (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "过滤新增广告",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "过滤新增广告": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "发送 Slack 预警通知",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
